# Integrator (main.js)

`src/main.js` may import every agent to construct and bind them. It must not contain collision math, GLSL, HUD markup, SQL, or WebSocket frame encoding.

Those belong in `src/engine`, `src/logic`, `src/ui`, `src/network`, or `server`.
